# Stalls (D388), the second reference game's beginning (ROADMAP Phase 5): a
# simple 3D tycoon. Each player owns coins and a cursor over a lot of twelve
# plots by twelve; a build puts a stall on the plot under the cursor when it
# is free and the owner has its cost, or raises one of the owner's own a
# level (D391), and each stall earns its owner every second for each level
# (tycoon.kest). The server decides every build; the lot's ground and the
# stalls are static bodies, so a build asks the physics which plots are
# taken, and looks up the stall it finds.
program tycoon.kest
physics3d gravity 0 -10 0
collision class stall b0eb8fc52cd9d4ac
component 0097c04f-e081-44c5-b93d-ba7a6836d3e8 tycoon.hand Hand
component 4143f760-31c1-469d-bda7-7946878bcaba tycoon.owner Owner
component 20f1dacf-e8f6-4c1f-be56-5fc36f9ade8e tycoon.stall Stall
# A stall's owner is an entity: sent as one, each client reads its own
# name for it (D390).
entity tycoon.stall owner
component 63d9aa3b-30b0-49df-9371-b682ff281ec0 tycoon.look rawframe.model.Model
component 2e380a54-69cf-4905-86f2-68f895d954fe tycoon.mark rawframe.model.Model
component 991e8dec-fbd5-4790-954b-283eea27fe90 tycoon.view rawframe.model.Camera
component 043c72ce-e948-490a-80d6-e3a22fbdb695 tycoon.purse rawframe.ui.Node
system tycoon.join simulation join write tycoon.owner
system tycoon.tend simulation tend read tycoon.hand write tycoon.owner write rawframe.physics3d.pose entities lookup tycoon.stall after tycoon.join after rawframe.physics3d.step
system tycoon.earn simulation earn write tycoon.owner after tycoon.tend
# The lot's ground, its top at nought.
spawn 1 rawframe.physics3d.body motion=0 shape=1 width=24 height=0.5 depth=24 rawframe.physics3d.pose y=-0.5 rawframe.physics3d.velocity

# Networked play: every owner and stall is sent to every client; each
# player's hand is its input, and its pose the plot under its cursor.
replicate tycoon.owner tycoon.stall rawframe.physics3d.body rawframe.physics3d.pose
player tycoon.hand tycoon.owner rawframe.physics3d.pose
input tycoon.hand
# A client makes its hand from its player's actions (tycoon.actions) with
# sample.kest, from keys, a mouse, a gamepad, or a touch screen (the left
# half's stick to move the cursor, the right half to build); bots press the
# same controls.
actions tycoon.actions
sample sample.kest sample

# What a client shows (D389): every body as a box, the ground green and the
# stalls red, its own stalls gold (D390); its own cursor's plot marked; the
# lot seen from a fixed point above its south edge; and its coins in words
# (tycoon.strings) in Inter 4.1 (Inter-Regular.ttf from its release archive,
# SIL Open Font License 1.1 in Inter-LICENSE.txt), along the top of its
# view. No server carries any of it.
text tycoon.strings
locale en
font 8e12f827f47f7d51 Inter-Regular.ttf
label f1182d0420cc09a0 tycoon.strings hud.coins coins
presentation tycoon.look on rawframe.physics3d.body
present tycoon.dress dress read rawframe.physics3d.body write tycoon.look
present tycoon.tint tint read tycoon.stall write tycoon.look
presentation tycoon.mark tycoon.view tycoon.purse on player
present tycoon.mark mark read tycoon.owner write tycoon.mark
present tycoon.frame frame read rawframe.physics3d.pose write tycoon.view
present tycoon.purse purse read tycoon.owner write tycoon.purse
